DAT
id=qid::label=str::text=lstr::
31166::$$$message_0233_0000_0000$$$::I'll go check out the town.[lr]::
31167::$$$message_0233_0000_0001$$$::I know what Saber said, but there are some things I can't know unless I'm alone.::
31168::$$$message_0233_0001_0000$$$::I slip outside, doing my best to stay unnoticed.[lr]::
31169::$$$message_0233_0001_0001$$$::It's peaceful around the Emiya house. Not a suspicious figure in sight.::
31170::$$$message_0233_0002_0000$$$::"...I see. So it's recreating what happened half a year ago."[lr]::
31171::$$$message_0233_0002_0001$$$::Why did I go outside alone, you ask?[lr]::
31172::$$$message_0233_0002_0002$$$::Why didn't I ask Saber for help?[lr]::
31173::$$$message_0233_0002_0003$$$::An outside observer would be able to understand.::
31174::$$$message_0233_0003_0000$$$::No matter how little danger there is, any rational person would know better than to venture outside alone.[lr]::
31175::$$$message_0233_0003_0001$$$::Just because there aren't any enemies around doesn't mean that there isn't something strange going on in town.[lr]::
31176::$$$message_0233_0003_0002$$$::Apparently, acting alone is only useful as a fishing strategy to offer myself up as bait.[lr]::
31177::$$$message_0233_0003_0003$$$::...Speaking for myself, I know it's bad that I don't even know my own intentions until I act.::
31178::$$$message_0233_0004_0000$$$::"I just made this choice on a whim... But well, everything's a learning experience."[lr]::
31179::$$$message_0233_0004_0001$$$::I start walking, staring up at the night sky.[lr]::
31180::$$$message_0233_0004_0002$$$::I can just go back to the house if I sense danger, and hole up in my room until tomorrow.::
31181::$$$message_0233_0005_0000$$$::I gaze at the moon.[lr]::
31182::$$$message_0233_0005_0001$$$::The moonlight illuminates the darkness, making the air seem clear and serene.[lr]::
31183::$$$message_0233_0005_0002$$$::Now, then...[lr]::
31184::$$$message_0233_0005_0003$$$::I hope I can find something so out of the ordinary that even a blockhead like me can understand it.::ü•